{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "満開っ！🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6期生の長嶋凛桜（ながしまりお）です。"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202604/mobCnCzeV.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「桜橋を教えてくれた」のMV が先日公開されました‼︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この衣装、とっても可愛かった!"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ビーズのネックレスがお気に入りです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さん観てくれたかな?"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まだという方は是非👀↓↓"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/TNHVgK7HLfY?si=s_jZuv2Udf4pTpQJ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "撮影の日は物凄く気持ちのいい晴れの日で"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "春の訪れを感じました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "というのも束の間"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "長嶋、そろそろ夏到来を感じております"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "来るぞ､､､あの暑い､､､灼熱の日々が､､､"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "長嶋熱々アラート発令中🚨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ずっと春で良いのになぁ"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202604/mobSJGWMe.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "りおここ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんだかんだ､､､"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "タイムリミット片想い"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なぜ、僕たちは走るのか？"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "市営ダンスホール"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "全力ラップタイム"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6期生楽曲は全部シンメだったんですよね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちょっと寂しいけど！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆んなで素敵なこの曲を沢山届けられたらなと思います！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "愛宕心響ちゃんがセンターの「桜橋を教えてくれた」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "春らしい可愛さや儚さを感じられる一曲です"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "是非沢山聴いてください！🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また書くね☺︎"}], "source": "official"}